#: vncviewer/vncviewer.cxx:415
msgid ""
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"\n"
"  -display Xdisplay  - Specifies the X display for the viewer window\n"
"  -geometry geometry - Initial position of the main TuPigVNC window. See the\n"
"                       man page for details.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"选项：\n"
"\n"
"  -display Xdisplay  - 指定查看器窗口所在的 X display\n"
"  -geometry geometry - TuPigVNC 主窗口的初始位置。详见 man 手册页。\n"

#: unix/vncconfig/vncconfig.cxx:189 unix/w0vncserver/w0vncserver.cxx:87
#: unix/x0vncserver/x0vncserver.cxx:294 unix/xserver/hw/vnc/xvnc.c:223
#: vncviewer/vncviewer.cxx:422
msgid ""
"\n"
"Parameters can be turned on with -<param> or off with -<param>=0\n"
"Parameters which take a value can be specified as -<param> <value>\n"
"Other valid forms are <param>=<value> -<param>=<value> --<param>=<value>\n"
"Parameter names are case-insensitive.  The parameters are:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"参数可以用 -<param> 开启，或用 -<param>=0 关闭\n"
"需要取值的参数可以写作 -<param> <value>\n"
"其他有效形式为 <param>=<value> -<param>=<value> --<param>=<value>\n"
"参数名不区分大小写。可用参数如下：\n"
"\n"

